'''Head Rococo''' is an [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] enemy that appears in the [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 8.5 Update|Version 8.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Head Rococo
|image = E 456.png
|appearance = [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 4,500¢ - 17,775¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has a massive DPS of 18,518 and can easily plow through your defenses if you're not careful. It also possesses relatively high speed and an [[Omni Strike]] reaching from -350 to 425 range! It also has a guaranteed chance to [[Freeze|freeze]] your cats for 4 seconds, making it a very good pusher. However, it has one weakness; its somewhat long attack animation.

